1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,579
I am Johnny Anak Berangan.

2
00:00:02,619 --> 00:00:05,701
I was born on 15 December 1974.

3
00:00:05,741 --> 00:00:13,960
I am the Adiguru Kraf of the parang Ilang,
from Batu 16, Jalan Oya, Sibu, Sarawak.

4
00:00:14,000 --> 00:00:16,931
I grew up with the sound of the hammer.

5
00:00:16,971 --> 00:00:22,000
My father was a parang smith, and
my uncle was a parang smith too.

6
00:00:23,000 --> 00:00:26,460
Since I was small I watched them forge the

7
00:00:26,500 --> 00:00:30,043
motifs and the designs of the parang Ilang.

8
00:00:30,083 --> 00:00:34,960
I learned all of it from them,
and from my own inspiration.

9
00:00:35,000 --> 00:00:39,392
I began taking it up seriously in 1992.

10
00:00:39,432 --> 00:00:45,000
At first I made them and
sold them at the market.

11
00:00:46,000 --> 00:00:49,612
After that I began to be
invited to exhibitions,

12
00:00:49,652 --> 00:00:52,960
to demonstrate how the parang Ilang is made.

13
00:00:53,000 --> 00:00:58,627
I have mastered the whole process:
forging the blade and its edge,

14
00:00:58,667 --> 00:01:05,495
engraving the blade, making the hilt,
making the sheath, and weaving the rattan.

15
00:01:05,535 --> 00:01:10,000
One parang, one pair of
hands, from start to finish.

16
00:01:11,000 --> 00:01:14,867
I am often chosen to help run
craft industry development

17
00:01:14,907 --> 00:01:17,937
programmes organised by Kraftangan Malaysia,

18
00:01:17,977 --> 00:01:22,960
the Ministry of Rural Development,
and the Ministry of Tourism Malaysia.

19
00:01:23,000 --> 00:01:30,000
In the Jalan Oya area I was appointed
head among the blacksmith craftsmen.

20
00:01:32,000 --> 00:01:37,130
In 2011 I received the Special
Master Craftsman Award,

21
00:01:37,170 --> 00:01:40,864
in conjunction with National Craft Day.

22
00:01:40,904 --> 00:01:47,854
In 2012 I took first place in the best
craft competition, metal category,

23
00:01:47,894 --> 00:01:49,960
at National Craft Day.

24
00:01:50,000 --> 00:01:56,000
And in that same year I was recognised
as Adiguru Kraf of the parang Ilang.

25
00:01:58,000 --> 00:02:00,235
I am Johnny Anak Berangan.

26
00:02:00,275 --> 00:02:04,960
I have just recently finished
teaching three students.

27
00:02:05,000 --> 00:02:07,546
Because if no one carries it on,

28
00:02:07,586 --> 00:02:12,960
the sound of the hammer here in
Jalan Oya will fall silent one day.

29
00:02:13,000 --> 00:02:18,072
And when it falls silent, it is
not only the parang that is lost.

30
00:02:18,112 --> 00:02:20,000
Our history is lost too.
